# Clean Architecture

Business Logic

↓

Application Layer

↓

Infrastructure

↓

Database

Never call Prisma directly from UI.

Never place business logic inside React components.

------------------------------------------------

# Dependency Rules

UI

↓

Application

↓

Domain

↓

Infrastructure

Never reverse dependencies.

------------------------------------------------

# Components

Components must be reusable.

Small.

Single Responsibility.

No duplicated UI.

------------------------------------------------

# Services

Business logic belongs in Services.

Never inside Controllers.

Never inside Components.

------------------------------------------------

# Repository Pattern

